        "Title": "The Kamera Initiative - Part Thirteen",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLOMBIA",
        "PublicId": "112056788981",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5562b1ba-d12e-428d-886e-bc9f2c80c2f2).Image",
        "Description": "I&apos;ve managed to ID three more figures related to the Kamera, and apparently they each hold connections to the ICA. I reckon the Kamera&apos;s given up on trying to kill us themselves, and now they&apos;re setting up contracts with the ICA, effectively cementing our fate as dead men walking. But no matter. The target called Taita is a faux shaman, a tester of illegal drugs and a freelance agent. Buckman is a merc employed by the Kamera to hide evidence. Ramon is their messenger. Good luck.\r-V",
